{"id": "85938", "name": "חוקי חזקות – כפל חזקות y^a · y^b (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Given that the product \\(y^{{CT:0}} \\cdot y^{{CT:1}} = y^n\\) then \\(n=\\)[[input:ans1]].</p>\n<p>Enter your answer as an integer (whole number) with no decimal point.</p>\n<p>[[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Remember the standard laws of indices. \\[ y^{{CT:0}} \\cdot y^{{CT:1}}=y^{{{CT:0}}+{{CT:1}}}=y^{{CT:2}}. \\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "+", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "NumAbsolute", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "n", "testoptions": "0", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-IND-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "NUM-IND-0-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "NumAbsolute", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "aval*bval", "testoptions": "0", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "A_TIMES_B", "feedback": "<p>Note that it is not the case in general that \\(y^{a} \\cdot y^{b} = y^{{CT:3}}\\). In fact \\(y^{{CT:3}} = \\left(y^{a}\\right)^{b} = \\left(y^{b}\\right)^{a}\\).</p>\n<p>You may find the identity \\(y^{a} \\times y^{b} = y^{a + b}\\) helpful in solving this problem.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-IND-1-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["aval", "bval", "n", "ya", "yb"], "nvariants": 9}